   "why": "A quarter of your portfolio is in US assets, mostly S&P 500 funds, and higher yields tend to pressure share valuations. A stronger dollar can also lift THB values of US holdings. Your dashboard prices UOBSG-N, your gold fund, at its 10 Nov NAV. Gold futures are about 3.5% lower since then, so that loss is not in your numbers yet; the dashboard refreshes again at 11:30.",
